        "eyebrow": "About us",
        "heading": "A dispensary that still weighs things.",
        "heading_size": "xl",
        "body": "CanMed started in 2009 as a single Kensington bench where a pharmacist made suspensions for children who couldn't swallow tablets. Three dispensaries later, the work is the same: read the script properly, weigh accurately, label clearly, and explain it to the person taking it. We don't outsource compounding, and we don't dispense anything a pharmacist hasn't personally reviewed."
